{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Weight of</b> — construct state." "<b>and burden</b> — Targum: וישא. The meaning is the weight of a stone, and the sand is likened in heaviness by way of metaphor." "<b>and a fool's wrath</b> — heavier."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:58.488942626Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}